      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "#### Color changing task\n\nIn the following code cell,\n* Complete the first line so that it assigns a different G number to `nextGNumber`\n* Complete the second line so that it invokes the `generateColor` method with the argument `nextGNumber`\n* Run the cell.\n\nIf everything works, the displayed color should have changed. If that doesn't happen, first click on \"Clear All Outputs\" and \"Restart\" at the top of this window and select Yes in the dialog at the lower right. Then, try running each cell again from the beginning of the notebook.",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "markdown",
        "id": "2905c731-b8d6-411a-ab7b-a8a1cbc615cf"
      }
    },
