      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "#### Adding a second label with a second color task\n\nThe following code cell has comments that describe what you should do to generate a new label with a new color. There are lines  of magic code at the beginning and end that you should not change. And don't add any code after those lines. Run the cell to see the effect of your changes. Remember that Clear All Outputs/Restart to force everything to start over can sometimes fix problems.\n\nWhen everything has run correctly, you should have a display that shows two different colors and two names.",
      "metadata": {
